# --- Local data and outputs ---
# Don't commit field data, intermediate CSVs/XYZs, inversion outputs or plots.
# Put samples in `examples/` and add them explicitly if you really want them in
# the repo.
*.xyz
*.csv
*.tif
*.tiff
*.png
*.jpg
*.pdf
!examples/**/*.xyz
!examples/**/*.csv
!docs/**/*.png
!docs/**/*.jpg
